## Parameter ownership

Configure every parameter you want to keep. Writes replace the complete object. Changing an ordinary parameter or a `marketplace` acknowledgment can overwrite a secret rotated elsewhere. Omitting `parameters` can clear existing values. Changing only `timeouts` skips the write.

Contentful can mask secrets even when a refresh appears to match the plan. See [App Installation secrets](../guides/secrets-and-state#app-installation-secrets) for rotation and import.

